{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207620","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207620","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1720762001:1":{"text":"Behold... the <style=\"highlight\">Crown of Thorns</style>.","source_cn":"这就是……<style=highlight>荆棘之冠<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6ADA58A1D40B4F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::2":{"text":"Crown of Thorns","source_cn":"荆棘之冠","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1B364D8312A94E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720762002:1":{"text":"King Rolan named this crown and wore it on the day of his coronation.","source_cn":"罗兰大帝在加冕那天戴的就是这顶王冠，也是他亲自赐予了它...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE57A8FE505F7AC4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720762003:1":{"text":"Thorns? But I don't see any spikes on it...","source_cn":"荆棘？但这上面并没有尖刺啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x235773E537476D28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1720762003":{"text":"Thorns? But I don't see any spikes on it...","source_cn":"荆棘？但这上面并没有尖刺啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x235773E537476D28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720762004:1":{"text":"The meaning of the name eluded me before, but looking at it now, I think I'm starting to grasp it.","source_cn":"我以前也不明白。但现在看着它，我好像……有些懂了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AD068E60A07999A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720762005:1":{"text":"... The crown is a burden as well as a blessing. Power grants achievement, but it also invites danger.","source_cn":"……王权很沉重，外表看起来华丽，里面却可能布满了伤人的尖刺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AA972202F878807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720762006:1":{"text":"For the sake of power, even the closest of kin can turn against each other.","source_cn":"为了这顶王冠，哪怕是曾经亲如手足的家人，也会反目成仇，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D8E41D1C159F3E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720762007:1":{"text":"From the moment the crown rests upon your head, duty binds you like unseen brambles. Their thorns pierce you constantly, reminding you through pain...","source_cn":"戴上它的那一刻起，责任就会像无形的荆棘一样，紧紧禁锢着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E82055289259B6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720762008:1":{"text":"That you are no longer your own—you must now answer to the hopes and expectations of your people.","source_cn":"你不再属于你自己，你背负的是无数人的牺牲，和无数期盼你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C45B1DBAE54EA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720762009:1":{"text":"This is the pain Father and Mother have been enduring as they lead the empire forward. I must rise and share their burden!","source_cn":"这些年，父王和母后就是忍受着这样的刺痛，在带领耀光前行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x662BF3F403A54180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"It could be a metaphor.","source_cn":"也许是隐喻","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65BCCAF518E44F70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It could be a metaphor.","female":"It could be a metaphor.","variant_male_record_index":"90671","variant_female_record_index":"90672","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"Don't take it literally.","source_cn":"不能只看表面","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x423226792E91C7DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't take it literally.","female":"Don't take it literally.","variant_male_record_index":"90673","variant_female_record_index":"90674","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"Peggy","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"Gwyneth","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"